WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.900
- I'm glad you're here.

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:03.250
I was going to call you because
I was noticing all the cool

00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:05.470
fashion in the city. And
I was wondering like,

00:00:05.470 --> 00:00:09.050
what were Tim Gunn's top tips
for conquering New York with

00:00:09.050 --> 00:00:11.920
style? Do you maybe have
a few asking for friend?

00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:15.470
- Well, I have. I'm
always filled with chips,

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:17.300
um especially what not to do,

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:18.133
- Okay

00:00:18.133 --> 00:00:18.966
but also what to do,

00:00:18.966 --> 00:00:20.917
And as someone from Los Angeles,

00:00:20.917 --> 00:00:21.750
- Yes

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:22.583
I just have to say,

00:00:22.583 --> 00:00:25.270
you should never leave home
here without an extra pair of

00:00:25.270 --> 00:00:27.158
shoes. It may sound strange,

00:00:27.158 --> 00:00:28.160
- Kelly: No it doesn't.

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:29.770
but we're not Los Angeles.

00:00:29.770 --> 00:00:31.730
- I see these girls be walking
around in heels and I'm like,

00:00:31.730 --> 00:00:32.563
no, we have.

00:00:32.563 --> 00:00:34.750
- Subway steps and we
have unpredictable weather

00:00:34.750 --> 00:00:35.940
- Nike's

00:00:35.940 --> 00:00:37.830
and, were constantly chasing taxis.

00:00:37.830 --> 00:00:41.090
So we need good pair of shoes
and we need to be able to

00:00:41.090 --> 00:00:42.250
change out on them as well.

00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:44.060
- Okay. So you got to carry
those with you in a bag.

00:00:44.060 --> 00:00:45.084
- Yes

00:00:45.084 --> 00:00:46.500
- Okay. Okay. Check. Okay. Anything else?

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:48.550
- That leads us into our number two item

00:00:48.550 --> 00:00:51.664
which is you must have a tote bag

00:00:51.664 --> 00:00:54.190
containing all of your needs for the day.

00:00:54.190 --> 00:00:55.587
- Done. I'm a woman so.

00:00:55.587 --> 00:00:56.420
(echoed laughter)

00:00:56.420 --> 00:00:57.840
- But you know, we're walking city.

00:00:57.840 --> 00:00:58.673
- Yes

00:00:58.673 --> 00:01:01.560
- So we pack up the tote for
what the needs are for that

00:01:01.560 --> 00:01:03.260
particular day. And off we go.

00:01:03.260 --> 00:01:05.230
- I got you, any other tips?

00:01:05.230 --> 00:01:07.610
- Well, yes, and this is called

00:01:07.610 --> 00:01:10.823
Just loosening up and feeling free.

00:01:10.823 --> 00:01:11.656
- Check

00:01:11.656 --> 00:01:13.790
- What I love the most about the city.

00:01:13.790 --> 00:01:14.623
- Got it

00:01:14.623 --> 00:01:16.420
- What I love most about the
city is that when it comes to

00:01:16.420 --> 00:01:18.440
fashion, anything goes,

00:01:18.440 --> 00:01:21.430
you can be exuberant and avant-garde,

00:01:21.430 --> 00:01:25.690
you can be minimal, and quiet.

00:01:25.690 --> 00:01:28.100
This city doesn't judge you for

00:01:28.100 --> 00:01:29.900
how you express yourself and how you

00:01:29.900 --> 00:01:30.733
present yourself.

00:01:30.733 --> 00:01:31.566
(audience cheering)

00:01:31.566 --> 00:01:33.776
- I do love that! I love that you can

00:01:33.776 --> 00:01:35.050
just walk around the city and you see,

00:01:35.050 --> 00:01:36.490
just all walks of life,

00:01:36.490 --> 00:01:38.720
all different types of like personalities.

00:01:38.720 --> 00:01:40.280
I love that the city embraces that.

00:01:40.280 --> 00:01:43.130
Like I came from like a city
where it was very weird to do

00:01:43.130 --> 00:01:44.180
like the smallest thing.

00:01:44.180 --> 00:01:45.013
Like everybody kind of
looked cookie cutter.

00:01:45.013 --> 00:01:46.110
- Tim: Oh Yeah! usually.

00:01:46.110 --> 00:01:47.150
So I love, I know,

00:01:47.150 --> 00:01:48.840
but I love that. I
think it's so inspiring,

00:01:48.840 --> 00:01:51.340
especially just the arts.
I think that, you know,

00:01:51.340 --> 00:01:52.350
it's like a,

00:01:52.350 --> 00:01:55.520
a flag of like freedom and that
feeling of really being able

00:01:55.520 --> 00:01:56.800
to be free and be yourself.

00:01:56.800 --> 00:01:57.992
I love that this city is like that.

00:01:57.992 --> 00:01:59.973
- I completely agree, the city wants

00:01:59.973 --> 00:02:02.264
you to be who you are and
that's a beautiful thing.

00:02:02.264 --> 00:02:03.097
- I love that.

